  <para unique="1261295">
   <string>The C1 flag is set to the sign of the value in ST(0), regardless of whether the register is empty or full.</string></para>
  <para unique="1261296">
   <string>This instruction&#8217;s operation is the same in non-64-bit modes and 64-bit mode.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
 <subsection title="FPU Flags Affected">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
